! Porter's Pebble — FTLS Card

<<~ ahu #/card>>

!! Porter's Pebble
//Stuckforce Relic, the Patient Mule//

''Item · 1 slot · recharges in sunlight''

A warm, palm-sized pebble of Long Ago make. Press it and it unfolds the ''Floating Disc'' Power — run from the relic, not the bearer's own practice. The bearer need not know the Power. Drop, theft, sundering, or a jam ends it; Corruption curses the pebble, not the carrier.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/holds>>

!! Holds

This item carries one Power. The card shows it as a doorway — tap through to the live module:

<<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/sdm/modules/powers/floating-disc">>

The carried Floating Disc runs at its own card's stats (P:2 · R:30m · T:point · D:1 hour); the relic changes only who sources it and how it is held.

<<~/ahu>>

